{"c":[{"id":"54b806582777cca4","sum":"Mac CI defaults to Xcode 16.4 on macos-15; #available still type-checks, so keep the Xcode 26 select in ci.yml and #if compiler-gate new SDK APIs. The 2026-09-19 hackathon was happy-path only.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T175827Z-8c1a94d022e0b4f9","text":"2026-09-19 hackathon: GSD and happy-path only; ship, do not polish; preflight must not block on niceties","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T180736Z-4ff972dc89772e30","text":"Mac CI (macos-15) defaults to Xcode 16.4; #available is runtime-only and still type-checks. Keep the Xcode 26 select in ci.yml and #if compiler-gate new SDK APIs.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3a7837f8430ada51","sum":"Mac CI on main runs macos-26 (glassEffect needs Xcode 26); do not move it back to macos-15. Screenpipe 0.4.50 keeps no clipboard history unless launched with --disable-clipboard-capture false, which Caret's pinned launch does not pass.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T180843Z-c0da2dfb3d09eb5e","text":"Mac CI on main is macos-26 for glassEffect/Xcode 26. Do not move that job back to macos-15 default Xcode 16.4.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T181107Z-8c8e5b028a0a7d1d","text":"Screenpipe 0.4.50 stores no clipboard history by default; enable with --disable-clipboard-capture false. Caret pin launch does not pass that flag.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
